cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: bufpool
abstract: >-
  A byte-buffer pool for Go whose buffers match bytes.Buffer's read/write
  behavior and return to the pool on Close, and whose strike heuristic evicts
  oversized, under-used backing arrays so that one large request does not pin
  memory for the small ones after it.
authors:
  - given-names: Johan
    family-names: Lindvall
repository-code: "https://github.com/JohanLindvall/bufpool"
url: "https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/JohanLindvall/bufpool"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - go
  - golang
  - buffer pool
  - memory management
  - garbage collection
